                  </coding>
               </code>
               <text>
                  <status value="generated"/>
                  <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Dear colleague, I am writing to inform you about the recent hospital admission of your patient, a 50-year-old male, who presented on 27/07/2021 with acute right lower quadrant abdominal pain, nausea, and low-grade fever, clinically consistent with acute appendicitis. Diagnostic workup included physical examination, laboratory blood tests, and abdominal ultrasound, which confirmed the diagnosis. The patient was haemodynamically stable throughout his stay. He underwent a laparoscopic appendectomy on 28/07/2021 without intraoperative complications. Postoperatively, he received intravenous fluids, analgesic medication, and antibiotic therapy. Wound healing was satisfactory, vital signs remained stable, and the patient mobilised well. He was discharged home on 31/07/2021 in good general condition. Please arrange a follow-up appointment in approximately two weeks. Should you have any questions, do not hesitate to contact me.</div>
               </text>
            </section>
